    <item>
      <title>Google Earth 刚塞进 AI 生图，就被玩坏了：核电站、难民营、倒塌的埃菲尔铁塔，两天光速回滚</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/google-earth-ai--20260804124003875-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 12:40:03 +0800</pubDate>
